      "writtenOn": "2017-06-20T14:22:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Surprisingly, no, we don\u0027t.\n\nIn testing I ran into an issue where the Juju stable PPA installed a newer version of juju on subsequent playbook runs, which broke things and wasn\u0027t idempotent.",
      "parentUuid": "9a0e1d27_af04a47e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 8,
