      "writtenOn": "2017-06-20T14:22:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I can revert this - bumping the version here should be a separate patchset.\n\nIn any case, Ansible 2.3 should work correctly as it was only an issue in MaaS and those issues were fixed a while ago.",
